,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**Core governance**\n- Board of trustees with an independent majority, which approves the advisory contract under Section 15(c)\n- Registered investment adviser, plus any sub-adviser\n- Chief Compliance Officer under Rule 38a-1\n- Fund counsel and independent-trustee counsel\n- Independent auditor\n- Valuation designee (Rule 2a-5) and liquidity program administrator (Rule 22e-4), usually the adviser\n\n**Service providers (often bundled)**\n- Custodian, fund administrator/accountant and transfer agent, frequently one bank\n- Distributor/principal underwriter, a registered broker-dealer\n- Series-trust or \"white-label\" platforms can supply the board, CCO, administration and distribution as a package\n\n**Market infrastructure**\n- Exchange listing and lead market maker\n- CUSIP and DTC/NSCC eligibility\n- Authorized participant agreements and a basket/creation-redemption process compliant with Rule 6c-11\n- Daily website disclosures\n\n**Strategy- or program-specific**\n- Index license and calculation agent, for index ETFs\n- Securities-lending agent, often the custodian\n- Derivatives risk manager (Rule 18f-4), plus ISDA/FCM counterparties\n- Exemptive relief for semi-transparent structures","ttft_ms":7369,"type":"result","duration_ms":10906,"uuid":"737cde6f-a6a8-45f1-8ac3-4ba116dd9bfa","ttft_stream_ms":1515,"time_to_request_ms":58,"first_content_frame_ms":1515,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
